      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The UK is considered to have the highest rates of morbidity and mortality among children and adults with asthma in Europe. According to the National Review of Asthma Deaths (NRAD), 28 children died in the UK between February 2012 and January 2013 because of asthma. Most of these deaths would be considered preventable by respiratory specialists."},
